---
name: summarize-input
description: What the summarising model is given - the summary so far, if any, and the messages to fold into it.
inputs:
  previous: the summary written on an earlier turn (empty the first time)
  transcript: the messages leaving the window, "User: …" and "Assistant: …"
---
{{#previous}}
Summary so far:
{{previous}}

Continue it with these later messages:
{{/previous}}
{{^previous}}
Summarise these messages:
{{/previous}}

{{transcript}}
